{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This George lived for only 40 years - from 1593 until 1633. Nevertheless, he became a great poet. However, none of his works was published while he was alive.","George Herbert"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
