{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This John was one of the greatest English poets in the 17th century. He belonged to the group of the so-called metaphysical poets. It was his meditations that gave Hemingway the idea about the title of For Whom the Bell Tolls.","John Donne"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
