{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["She was one of the few female pirates. She was the daughter of a lawyer and his servant. Although her father taught her how to run a plantation, her ardent temperament led her to piracy. She fell deeply in love with Calico Jack Rackham and started crossing the seas with him. She did not stop even after giving birth to their child - she left the baby with other pirate families, so that she could sail along with Rackham.","Anne Bonny"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
